px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s3\">東京都出身、高校</span><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s3\">年生</span><span class=\"s2\">16</span><span class=\"s3\">歳です。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:20.3px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:20.3px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:20.3px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:20.3px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s3\">本日</span><span class=\"s2\">20</span><span class=\"s3\">時</span><span class=\"s2\">30</span><span class=\"s3\">から</span><span class=\"s2\">SHOWROOM</span><span class=\"s3\">配信をします！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:20.3px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s3\">今どのヘアアレンジをしようか悩んでおります。何になるのかお楽しみにしていてください</span><span class=\"s2\">(&nbsp;<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s4\">ᵒ̴̷͈</span><span class=\"s5\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Euphemia UCAS&quot;\">ᗨ</span><span class=\"s4\">ᵒ̴̶̷͈</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;)</span><span class=\"s6\">✧</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:20.3px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin:0px;f